[img]https://i.imgur.com/QZXOEJC.jpg[/img]

Dear Friends,

One of the goals of Closed Beta Tests is searching for errors, bugs and other not-so-nice moments. And don't we just love it when we can fix stuff even before the end of the test!

Tomorrow morning we shall install a patch that will fix a number of problems discovered during the test:

1) improved the work of the matchmaker, so matches are made faster;
2) fixed the bug with the Phantom's Cloaking blocked at the base;
3) the shop now works correctly;
4) fixed the matches history screen;
5) fixed the post-match achievements screen;
6) fixed "error 12" in the lobby;
7) changed the news screen design;
8) fixed miscellaneous minor errors and bugs.

Maintenance will start at 9 a.m. and last until 9.30 on Saturday, March 31.

Have a great game!

